---
// Ill10TwoButtons.astro
// Visual brief: Two Policy Levers — Pass-Through vs Exemption
---

<div class="my-10 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm not-prose font-sans w-full max-w-2xl mx-auto">
  <div class="px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 bg-slate-100/60 dark:bg-navy-950/60 flex items-center justify-between">
    <div>
      <div class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 font-semibold">Editorial Visual 10</div>
      <h3 class="text-base text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-semibold m-0">The Two Policy Levers</h3>
    </div>
    <span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 bg-teal-500/10 text-teal-600 dark:text-teal-400 rounded border border-teal-500/20 font-medium">GIFT IFSC Design</span>
  </div>

  <div class="p-6">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <!-- Lever 1 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50 text-center">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-900/40 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs mx-auto mb-2 font-mono">
          A
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 block">Structural Conduit</span>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Pass-Through</h4>
        <div class="my-3 py-1.5 px-3 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 rounded font-mono text-xs font-bold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-900">
          WHO IS TAXED?
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 m-0">Determines whether the fund or the unit holder is the taxpayer.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Lever 2 -->
      <div class="p-4 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-navy-800/60 border border-emerald-200 dark:border-emerald-800/50 text-center">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-900/40 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs mx-auto mb-2 font-mono">
          B
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 block">Fiscal Incentive</span>
        <h4 class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-1">Exemption / Concession</h4>
        <div class="my-3 py-1.5 px-3 bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-950/50 rounded font-mono text-xs font-bold text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300 border border-emerald-100 dark:border-emerald-900">
          WHAT IS TAXED?
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-slate-500 m-0">Zero-rates specific offshore capital gains or derivatives trades (e.g. in IFSC).</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-6 py-3 bg-slate-100/50 dark:bg-navy-950/40 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-navy-800 text-center">
    <p class="text-xs italic text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 m-0">India can refuse general Category III pass-through while still offering targeted tax concessions to qualifying specified funds in GIFT IFSC. One does not imply the other.</p>
  </div>
</div>
